==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|дать|-ся}}. Compare {{cog|pl|dać|dać się}}, {{cog|it|darsi}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|да́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Rominf-даться.wav}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|да́ться|pf|impf=дава́ться}}

# to [[let]] oneself, to [[allow]] oneself (to be caught, to be cheated, etc.)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не]] '''дава́ться''' [[в]] [[обида|оби́ду]]|not to allow oneself to be pushed around/over}}
# to [[come]] [[easily]]
#: {{ux|ru|Ему́ [[не]] '''даю́тся''' [[иностранный|иностра́нные]] [[язык|языки́]].|Foreign languages don't come easily to him.}}
# {{infl of|ru|дать||pass}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|irreg/c''|да́ться}}
